(( Run with: rco run examples/collections.rco ))

users array
"Ada" users get .push! drop
"Grace" users get .push! drop
1 "Lin" users get .insert! drop
1 users get .remove-at! drop

settings map
"theme" "dark" settings get .put! drop

0 6 range numbers var
[ 2 * ] numbers get .transform doubled var
[ 4 > ] doubled get .select selected var

"users:" println
users get .count println
0 users get .at println
", " users get .join println

"settings:" println
"theme" settings get .at println
settings get .keys .count println

"numbers:" println
0 [ + ] selected get .reduce println
[ 10 = ] doubled get .any? println
[ 2 > ] doubled get .all? println
[ 8 = ] doubled get .find println

queue list
1 queue get .push! drop
2 queue get .push! drop
queue get .count println

tags Set
"rco" tags get .push! drop
"rco" tags get .push! drop
tags get .count println
